>>
Rule 1 (input tensor can have any dimensionality)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 2 (all shape dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀ i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 3 (scalar or empty tensors are allowed)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 then shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 0
